{"product_id":"caliburn-explorer-replacement-pods","title":"Caliburn Explorer Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn Explorer pods are designed for use with the Caliburn Explorer kit only. Featuring a unique split-pod design, these pods can hold two different e-liquids and coils at once, which can be vaped separately or together. Compatible with Caliburn G \u0026amp; G2 coils, these pods will deliver your choice of MTL (Mouth To Lung) or RDTL (Restricted Direct To Lung) inhale.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRefillable Pods For Caliburn Explorer\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml E-Liquid Capacity – 1ml Per Side\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide-Filling Design\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/uwell\" title=\"Uwell Kenya\"\u003eCompatible With Caliburn G \u0026amp; G2 Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSuited To 50\/50 And High PG E-Liquids\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach half of a Caliburn Explorer pod requires its own coil and e-liquid. This allows you to swap between two different flavours and coil resistances, or even vape both at once. To refill, simply open up the rubber stoppers on each side of the pod. The compatible coils from the Caliburn G and G2 series (sold separately) work best when paired with 50% VG or high PG e-liquid.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 x Caliburn Explorer Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775215542327,"sku":"Cali Explorer Replace Pods","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell-caliburn-explorer-replacement-pod-min.jpg?v=1752512527","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-explorer-replacement-pods","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




